Name Rio Note - Military #1 Recruitment

Interactability_Text_Line_0 Captain Francisco de Oliveira,
Interactability_Text_Line_1 Today's enlistment process has witnessed an unprecedented surge in the number of eager male adults seeking to join the ranks of the army. Their motivations range from a noble desire to combat and contain the turned outbreak to longstanding aspirations of military service. 
Interactability_Text_Line_2 It is imperative to alert all headquarters to brace themselves for an influx of these new recruits. Prepare to welcome and integrate as many of these willing souls as our ranks can accommodate.
Interactability_Text_Line_3 Best regards,
Interactability_Text_Line_4 Lieutenant Orlando Machado